{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國電信（BT）行政總裁表示，在馬斯克旗下衞星互聯網服務Starlink近期因服務中斷而引發爭議、影響烏克蘭軍方行動後，BT將暫緩啓動雙方的合作項目，直至「相關爭議平息」。英國電信行政總裁艾莉森·柯克比（Allison Kirkby）表示，目前這項服務已經「準備就緒」，但考慮到幾周前烏克蘭發生的事件，BT對Starlink目前可能受到的輿論評價持謹慎態度。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585780.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.943108+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T09:11:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"2e9b0030ade1294d0e8bb255a638787619be9c165784fe54fb0893bfb037b553","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}